Licence for the netlists in this directory
==========================================

The rest of embsim is MIT (see LICENSE at the repository root). The files
listed here are not: each is a transcription of a vendor schematic published
under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0, and is distributed under
that licence.

p2_ec32mb.net
-------------

Original work : "Propeller 2 Edge Module with 32MB RAM" schematic,
                part number P2-EC32MB, revision B, last update 29 Mar 2022,
                file P2-EC32MB-RevB-SCHEMATIC.pdf (8 pages), published by
                Parallax with the P2-EC32MB product downloads at
                https://www.parallax.com/

Creator       : Parallax Inc., 599 Menlo Drive, Rocklin, CA 95765

Copyright     : Copyright 2022 Parallax Incorporated.

Licence       : The schematic's title block states that it is Open Source
                Hardware licensed under the Creative Commons
                Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License
                (CC BY-SA 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Changes       : Transcribed by hand from the vendor PDF to KiCad netlist form
                (the KiCad netlist-export s-expression dialect). The eight
                schematic pages are merged into one netlist, and pin
                identifiers are normalised; the file's header records the
                conventions and how the transcription was checked.

This transcription is itself distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/ — as the licence's
ShareAlike term requires, and not under embsim's MIT licence. It is provided
as-is, without warranties of any kind; see section 5 of the licence. Its use
here does not imply that Parallax endorses embsim.
